*.log
.DS_Store

# apps/api and apps/admin are deliberately NOT excluded here any more. Both have their own
# deployed image: apps/api via .docker/admin.Dockerfile, apps/admin via
# .docker/admin-web.Dockerfile - the Vite build copied into /srv and served by Caddy, which
# needs apps/api in its context anyway for the committed openapi.json its build reads.
# "Local-only" describes *what a member is never bundled into*, and that is each Dockerfile's
# per-member COPY list, not this file. .dockerignore is shared by every build, so a rule here
# silently removes a member from images it belongs in; excluding apps/api is why this file
# had to change at all.

# Docker meta
Dockerfile
docker-compose*.yml
.dockerignore
